	<content contentuid="h0e067be6gc0deg4fd9gb9e1g724c27074b7d" version="1">当回合首次攻击时可发动鲁莽攻击，本回合所有基于&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Strength"&gt;力量&lt;/LSTag&gt;的近战武器&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻击检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;获得&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Advantage"&gt;优势&lt;/LSTag&gt;，但直到下回合前针对你的攻击检定也将获得优势。</content>
	<content contentuid="h916dbbf8gfa3cg4b03g81b5g460a1c10e687" version="1">鲁莽攻击</content>	
	<content contentuid="h188df833gf5dfg4850g9ea1g35f433141570" version="1">受影响者在本回合的近战武器&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRoll"&gt;攻击检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;中获得&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Advantage"&gt;优势&lt;/LSTag&gt;，但针对其的所有攻击检定同样获得优势。</content>
	<content contentuid="he954ef0dg1d1cg4766gb88bga1c81a5ad800" version="1">先祖守卫</content>
	<content contentuid="h7b62f7c3g5b2dg4044g9dddg9da06122f615" version="1">部分野蛮人来自崇尚祖先的部族文化。这些部族认为往昔战士会以英灵形态存世，继续守护生者。遵循此道的野蛮人进入狂暴状态时，将沟通灵界召唤先祖英灵助战。</content>
	<content contentuid="hdb23f621ge101g4895gb370ge13c33402f6f" version="1">获得物理伤害&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;抗性&lt;/LSTag&gt;，力量&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AbilityCheck"&gt;技能检定&lt;/LSTag&gt;与&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免&lt;/LSTag&gt;获得&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Advantage"&gt;优势&lt;/LSTag&gt;。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;本回合首个攻击目标将被先祖英灵标记，其攻击将受干扰。</content>
	<content contentuid="h9455eae3g1dc8g44cbgb8bag0eee0b0657e4" version="1">近战武器与投掷攻击造成额外[1]点伤害。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;具有物理伤害抗性，力量检定与豁免获得优势。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;无法施法或维持专注。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;先祖护佑：&lt;/b&gt;使受标记目标的攻击具有劣势并降低伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="h67791305g3606g46deg83afg6ba1d6b52210" version="1">先祖护佑</content>
	<content contentuid="h81ea1c3dgc28bg416eg9431g1cf5deed8abe" version="1">&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="RAGE"&gt;狂暴&lt;/LSTag&gt;状态下，本回合首个攻击目标将被先祖英灵标记。</content>
	<content contentuid="h1dc017f3g7164g4379ga7afg0fbc048e6751" version="1">测试文本</content>
	<content contentuid="hc75f664dgff26g40e0ga81bg04e6302cccf9" version="1">先祖护佑干扰</content>
	<content contentuid="he77fe716g1632g4152gb11dga67982d70cdf" version="1">受影响者的非指向先祖护佑来源的攻击将具有&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Disadvantage"&gt;劣势&lt;/LSTag&gt;且伤害减半。</content>
	<content contentuid="h0652aa2bg73d3g4fe3g9631g950d03b68bf9" version="1">灵体盾</content>
	<content contentuid="hff0ab3ebgcaa5g40a4gbee5g3780d1e14677" version="1">&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="RAGE"&gt;狂暴&lt;/LSTag&gt;期间，可使用&lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="ReactionActionPoint"&gt;反应动作&lt;/LSTag&gt;为[1]米内盟友减免伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="h8db050f9g6e45g40c5gb4aeg3d7866dc65b2" version="1">为[1]米内盟友减免伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="h6477a6ffgb386g4820g9593g423819eca1f0" version="1">伤害减少2d6点，10级提升至3d6，14级提升至4d6。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha0770a73gd4fag410agb3bagc2f2ee18e7e4" version="1">守护英灵</content>
	<content contentuid="hc9d5a633g9381g4d89gb017g1782220f4e2c" version="1">先祖问卜</content>
	<content contentuid="hf64a5a28gd3ddg41d8gb94dga1d9bf18830f" version="1">召唤隐形先祖英灵为你探察前路。</content>
	<content contentuid="hf5e0269dg3dc7g4b41g9ea5g797685b65603" version="1">先祖复仇</content>
	<content contentuid="hc3223932g8e52g4e71gbf05g0d74ecee2518" version="1">当你使用&lt;LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="SpiritShield"&gt;灵体盾&lt;/LSTag&gt;减免伤害时，攻击者将承受被减免数值的力场伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="h5d988d1dg3926g40cag9b68ge20f85bf394a" version="1">为[1]米内盟友减免[2]点伤害。若成功减免攻击伤害，攻击者将承受等量力场伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="hff5de892gf5bag478aga4ecg35b25d01e2e4" version="1">目标受到灵体盾保护。</content>

	<content contentuid="hfdfcfb58gcafdg494egad62g580c7d64f7df" version="1">战狂者</content>
	<content contentuid="heca1107bg39b6g45cbgaac2g0624e8cd3c76" version="1">矮人语称为「库达迦」（字面意为「斧痴」），战狂者是侍奉战争之神的矮人战士。他们擅长穿戴尖刺重甲冲入敌阵，以肉身作武器彻底投入战斗怒火。</content>
	<content contentuid="hd6f883d7g8abdg45ebg9551gda82b5e59275" version="1">库达迦</content>
	<content contentuid="hb26c9949g2d67g4d29ga7f1g391879f0fd9f" version="1">战狂重甲</content>
	<content contentuid="hdc85a2dag5af7g4fc2g9647gb7eceb43a48f" version="1">战狂重甲（擒抱）</content>
	<content contentuid="hb3b264efgf873g4fecg81a8g73322822feb5" version="1">战狂重甲（投掷）</content>	
	<content contentuid="hc6f69848g33c8g466eg84ebgefbbf746baa2" version="1">甲胄尖刺</content>
	<content contentuid="h1ddddec9g2043g4b06gb997g2970d3a1cdab" version="1">穿着中型金属甲且处于&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="RAGE"&gt;狂暴&lt;/LSTag&gt;时，可用&lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="BonusActionPoint"&gt;附加动作&lt;/LSTag&gt;对[1]米内目标发动一次尖刺近战攻击。</content>	
	<content contentuid="he6a1be96g780bg46d6gadd1gd3ecec909bd1" version="1">狂怒弃守</content>
	<content contentuid="hc2197a71g6188g48dcgae0dg1be82c01e23b" version="1">战狂冲锋</content>
	<content contentuid="h4a60c7d2ga5e3g49e2gac22ge93b2da6160c" version="1">鲁莽攻击（徒手）</content>
	<content contentuid="hc5100e69gd703g41c1g93a2g7da04a5cc491" version="1">鲁莽攻击（临时武器）</content>
	<content contentuid="h4bb051cfgec19g4166g8c22gbccb1cb12369" version="1">你是真正的斧痴。尽管有人试图模仿矮人这种近乎自杀的战斗风格，但无人能真正复制你那恐怖的力量、耐力与侵略性。</content>
	<content contentuid="h0cabe01ag5373g4e9dgb171gae81248370ff" version="1">进入战斗后，你会变得如同野兽——双目圆睁、牙关紧咬、唾沫从嘴角与胡须飞溅。你被教导要运用全身战斗，带刺的重甲让你能用冲撞、踢击甚至头槌造成致命打击。</content>
	<content contentuid="h2e1920b2g0538g4014g9e7cg51589e32f5f3" version="1">穿着中型金属甲且处于&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="RAGE"&gt;狂暴&lt;/LSTag&gt;时，可用&lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="BonusActionPoint"&gt;附加动作&lt;/LSTag&gt;对[1]米内目标发动尖刺攻击。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;使用擒抱或投掷攻击时，若检定成功则造成[2]点穿刺伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="h9e2e6a28gcdcag43c4gbb78g6f68a947bdd3" version="1">使用擒抱或投掷攻击时，若检定成功则造成[1]点穿刺伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="hb5c4079dg5e1bg487eg9ba2g12e3c617fd8f" version="1">使用擒抱攻击时，若擒抱检定成功则造成[1]点穿刺伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="h7afeb636ga82bg429dg8d31g50f0d43d6e5f" version="1">使用投掷攻击时，若投掷成功则造成[1]点穿刺伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="h2ce8296ag7179g4b9cgb462g0d5328a27282" version="1">&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="RAGE"&gt;狂暴&lt;/LSTag&gt;期间发动&lt;LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="RecklessAttack"&gt;鲁莽攻击&lt;/LSTag&gt;可获得[1]点临时生命，狂暴结束时未消耗的临时生命将消失。</content>
	<content contentuid="h17547d81ge9a9g4b5ega43ag87e3545987fe" version="1">通过&lt;LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="RecklessAbandon"&gt;狂怒弃守&lt;/LSTag&gt;获得[1]点&lt;LSTag Tooltip="TemporaryHitPoints"&gt;临时生命&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h7208377dg6089g4ea9gbc1cgeb747e653bb1" version="1">&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="RAGE"&gt;狂暴&lt;/LSTag&gt;期间可将&lt;LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Shout_Dash"&gt;疾行&lt;/LSTag&gt;作为&lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="BonusActionPoint"&gt;附加动作&lt;/LSTag&gt;使用。</content>
	<content contentuid="hdcfb552eg41a9g44d2gb70dg6f8a478c95b3" version="1">尖刺反击</content>
	<content contentuid="h4beb30dfgab5eg4919gba17g2ce4f973360f" version="1">当[1]米内生物对你发动近战攻击时，若你处于&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="RAGE"&gt;狂暴&lt;/LSTag&gt;状态、未&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="INCAPACITATED"&gt; incapacitated&lt;/LSTag&gt;且穿着中型金属甲，攻击者将受到[2]点伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="h4a1ccf74g3f7bg4192ga739g729cf72571b9" version="1">尖刺甲胄</content>
	<content contentuid="h59a1b929ged8ag4a6eg93f2g4366ff64d341" version="1">目标甲胄已附加可作为武器使用的尖刺。</content>

	<content contentuid="h400bde45ge4d3g4e70ga32eg2a31dba59e2e" version="1">野兽</content>
	<content contentuid="h61063ad0g5dc4g4b25g868dge086801dab95" version="1">野兽道途的野蛮人从灵魂深处的兽性火花中汲取狂暴力量。在怒意沸腾时，这股兽性将突破躯壳，使野蛮人产生物理变形。</content>
	<content contentuid="hc062d317gad17g47c1g90b9gee71747cf113" version="1">近战武器与投掷攻击造成额外[1]点伤害。狂暴持续期间，你将显化一种自然武器。</content>
	<content contentuid="h96862f98g4d79g4539ga3b0g901bffc37abf" version="1">你可以使用&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="RAGE"&gt;狂暴&lt;/LSTag&gt;特性。进入狂暴时将变形展现体内兽性之力。</content>	
	<content contentuid="he3fa131egda55g4195gb0f5g90c678da24a0" version="1">野兽之形（撕咬）</content>
	<content contentuid="h7ea9910bg2799g4e26g8d0agfa7460fd7778" version="1">你的嘴部变形为兽吻或巨颚，可发动&lt;LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Target_BeastFormBite"&gt;撕咬攻击&lt;/LSTag&gt;。若命中时生命值低于半数，可恢复[1]点生命值（每回合限一次）。</content>
	<content contentuid="h92b58a99g5765g4101gbf2ag261a9b16878f" version="1">撕咬目标，若命中时生命值低于半数则恢复[1]点生命值。</content>
	<content contentuid="h5e8f2fe2g2c3dg4e6ag8b27g70c7ed7b2507" version="1">此特性的生命恢复效果每回合仅限一次。</content>
	<content contentuid="h00c9723egcb23g4d9cg885dgb0416727a50c" version="1">野兽之形（利爪）</content>
	<content contentuid="hfd6966a3g3360g4075ga7b8g08c5bb6b4cee" version="1">野兽之形追加攻击（利爪）</content>
	<content contentuid="h70058487g78ceg4559g828eg3227267c9254" version="1">利爪连击</content>	
	<content contentuid="ha291c330g55bcg453egaa5fg3ad85628dcb6" version="1">双手变形为利爪，可发动&lt;LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Target_BeastFormClaws"&gt;爪击&lt;/LSTag&gt;。使用攻击动作发动爪击时，可追加一次爪击。</content>
	<content contentuid="h38b6b8ebgd24bg4bd6g9a28gda4ca1e59c2b" version="1">对目标发动爪击。当你使用攻击动作进行爪击时，可在同动作中追加一次爪击。</content>
	<content contentuid="hab408a6ag880bg4656gb52cg3a50764c0651" version="1">兽化形态（尾部）</content>
	<content contentuid="h8ac8eb24g8c80g426bg95e1g886852053dbd" version="1">你长出带有&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Reach"&gt;触及&lt;/LSTag&gt;属性的棘尾，可对[1]米内可见攻击者使用&lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="ReactionActionPoint"&gt;反应动作&lt;/LSTag&gt;扫尾，使攻击可能失手。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha0a29d0dgc5d0g4c95g8502g3f7a27cfd6d9" version="1">尾部攻击</content>
	<content contentuid="h416dcb42gd5fdg4270ga373gfbb9a2d32083" version="1">尾部防卫</content>
	<content contentuid="h877ce08dg161cg47d8gbfc9g93da5256613d" version="1">尾部（触及）</content>	
	<content contentuid="h4b2557f2g71d0g4b84g80d0g2252606ea0a6" version="1">左尾攻击范围</content>	
	<content contentuid="h091a6a99ga478g48degb368g8fc72640f3a0" version="1">目标脱离触及范围将引发&lt;LSTag Tooltip="OpportunityAttack"&gt;借机攻击&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>	
	<content contentuid="h41c7af1ag0c00g4d1cg807dgcb4d7758e76b" version="1">对[1]米内目标发动尾部鞭击。</content>
	<content contentuid="hd0c5f4e7gc7b8g4076ga960g92197dd9c54a" version="1">当[1]米内可见生物攻击你时，获得[2]点&lt;LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;AC&lt;/LSTag&gt;加值，可能使攻击失手。</content>
	<content contentuid="h1491987ag2fcfg4447gad32g9beaf73b3dff" version="1">野性之魂</content>
	<content contentuid="h68b2078ag5f3dg48bfgac74g4ae2b7f3bf0e" version="1">野性共鸣</content>
	<content contentuid="hf8616318gb315g4f4agba15g8eaefcf41255" version="1">野兽道途野蛮人可通过形态变化适应环境。</content>
	<content contentuid="h2e12ac31gfedeg42cfg9e6fgfbf8b8269f7a" version="1">你的兽化武器视为魔法武器，可穿透非魔法攻击&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;抗性&lt;/LSTag&gt;，并获得环境适应增益。</content>
	<content contentuid="h67b799c1g5096g464ag8307gf93e41c04b4c" version="1">此增益持续至完成&lt;LSTag Tooltip="ShortRest"&gt;短休&lt;/LSTag&gt;或&lt;LSTag Tooltip="LongRest"&gt;长休&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="h103955b3g547bg4137ga72agf2b052583cbe" version="1">选择一项环境适应增益。</content>
	<content contentuid="hb92d612cgd1aag4c5bg9978g3358e5af9c27" version="1">野性共鸣（泅水）</content>
	<content contentuid="h938126f9g042dg4935gb964g20880148c0c8" version="1">在水域地形移动速度提升[1]米。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha63a67d3g946ag44fbg9b73gc4bb783d47f0" version="1">处于水域地形时&lt;LSTag Tooltip="MovementSpeed"&gt;移动速度&lt;/LSTag&gt;提升[1]米。</content>
	<content contentuid="h42258e5aga404g48a4g8b51g59174cdb0454" version="1">野性共鸣（攀越）</content>
	<content contentuid="hedbe3c38g7f87g463fg9d6cgad2e8e51af71" version="1">可无视&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="DIFFICULT_TERRAIN"&gt;困难地形&lt;/LSTag&gt;进行&lt;LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Shout_Dash"&gt;疾冲&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="hb1f91817g06d0g4d7fga8cfgf76cab3c6b35" version="1">野性共鸣（腾跃）</content>
	<content contentuid="ha15843bcg4fceg4b5dg84b0gae01646526fd" version="1">&lt;LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Projectile_Jump"&gt;跳跃&lt;/LSTag&gt;距离增加[1]米。</content>
	<content contentuid="hb8a825c4gf438g4633g830fgf0aacbb580d4" version="1">你的&lt;LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Projectile_Jump"&gt;跳跃&lt;/LSTag&gt;距离提升[1]米。</content>
	<content contentuid="hbaf930eagde79g4d96g8d5fgde063015f80d" version="1">狂兽疫病</content>
	<content contentuid="h05ca76eeg3391g413eg95d7g6c1c02aefda8" version="1">疫病爆发</content>
	<content contentuid="hfc7dcab8g7817g4021g8213g90d7e02c39d6" version="1">狂兽疫病（伤害）</content>
	<content contentuid="h50b60748g937cg4050g982cg91b088bfeed8" version="1">狂兽疫病（攻击）</content>
	<content contentuid="haef3e349g03ceg4f61ga852gf54958d93b31" version="1">野兽道途野蛮人可使攻击目标感染狂暴兽疫。</content>
	<content contentuid="h8e6ebaffgd57cg4c9egacc1g786f525be99b" version="1">&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="RAGE"&gt;狂暴&lt;/LSTag&gt;期间使用天生武器命中目标时，可使其感染兽疫。</content>
	<content contentuid="hedf2b0c7gfc3dg4c4bg9050ge30b23e39c85" version="1">本能力每日可用次数等于&lt;LSTag Tooltip="ProficiencyBonus"&gt;熟练加值&lt;/LSTag&gt;。</content>
	<content contentuid="hdeb2f721ga2e6g4674gb92egc8256a078cef" version="1">被天生武器击中的目标受到额外伤害。</content>
	<content contentuid="h6f1a912egd939g4a1bg92f9g8b596a90f0d2" version="1">目标进入&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="RABID_ATTACKER"&gt;狂乱&lt;/LSTag&gt;状态，必须使用&lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="ReactionActionPoint"&gt;反应动作&lt;/LSTag&gt;攻击你指定的可见目标。</content>		
	<content contentuid="h8c49eaa8gca7bg4efcgabb8g1a3b25aaf971" version="1">兽疫感染</content>
	<content contentuid="h7e9cb57eg3f57g4241g8b44g517488e95d92" version="1">受影响目标将使用反应动作攻击野兽道途野蛮人指定的目标。</content>
